[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（英音）]
[ti:A New House]
[00:12.81]Why is the new house special?
[00:18.46]I had a letter from my sister yesterday.
[00:22.41]She lives in Nigeria.
[00:25.69]In her letter, she said that she would come to England next year.
[00:31.58]If she comes, she will get a surprise.
[00:36.20]We are now living in a beautiful new house in the country.
[00:41.88]Work on it had begun before my sister left.
[00:46.52]The house was completed five months ago.
[00:51.43]In my letter, I told her that she could stay with us.
[00:56.87]The house has many large rooms and there is a lovely garden.
[01:03.23]It is a very modern house, so it looks strange to some people.
[01:09.50]It must be the only modern house in the district.
